Current Version can be found [https://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Jar_of_Worms here].
JoW was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the ability to summon 2 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Worm Worms] using Magic and SoT. This, however, was quickly nerfed to just 1 Worm in '''Beta 30.1''' a few hours later. '''Beta 33.1''' buffed it by dropping its cost from 5G to 4G.

'''Beta 41.1''' brought it back to 5G, but also gave it +1/+1, going from 0/5 to 1/6. It also gained an additional effect of giving all ally Worms +1 ATK at the end of every turn. '''Beta 45.0''' nerfed its Turn start effect to add a Worm to your hand rather than summoning it right away. '''Beta 47.0''' reverted its cost back to 4G and its SoT effect to match its Magic. Its EoT effect was also changed into an Aura. This came at the cost of its HP being reduced to 4 as well, but was mainly done to fit Worm's new stats (a change to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Worming_Up Worming Up] also happened because of it).
