=== Trivia ===
* Beta 45.0's Patch notes also mention stat changes, with HP going from 5 to 6 and Cost from 4G to 5G (which was part of the change in Beta 41.1).
** This mistake happened as its stats were dropped during testing, but was considered too strong for early game.
